  "content": "<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 750px; margin: auto; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: #fff; padding: 40px; border-top: 10px solid #004d40; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;\"><div style=\"flex-grow: 1;\"><h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; color: #333;\">{{school_name}}</h1><p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666;\">{{school_address}}</p></div><img src=\"{{school_logo_url}}\" style=\"height: 80px;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;\"><h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 1px;\">CERTIFICATE OF CHARACTER</h2></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; text-align: justify; color: #444;\"><p>This is to certify that <strong>{{student_name}}</strong>, Admission No: <strong>{{admission_no}}</strong>, has been a student of this school and has completed <strong>{{class_section}}</strong> in the academic year <strong>{{academic_session}}</strong>.</p><p>Throughout his/her time at the school, he/she has displayed a character that is commendable and conduct that is exemplary. He/She has been diligent in studies and respectful towards teachers and peers.</p><p>This certificate is issued at his/her request.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-top: 100px; font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"color: #888;\"><strong>Date:</strong> {{current_date}}</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"{{student_photo_url}}\" style=\"height: 45px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 5px; font-weight: 600;\">Signature of the Principal</p></div></div></div>",
